    "name": "Delta 13C in CO2 at Alert, NWT, Canada (June 1991 - December 2001)",
    "description": [
      "Measurements have been made on air collected in flasks at Alert, Canada, through the CSIRO GASLAB worldwide network. Flasks are filled with air at Alert and returned to the CSIRO GASLAB for analysis; typical sample storage times for flasks collected at Alert range from a few weeks to a few months. No significant effect on the stable carbon isotopic composition, \u03b413C, has been detected as a consequence of the sample storage time.",
      ""
